---
description: Guidelines for styling with Tailwind CSS (v3.4)
globs: **/*.html
globs: **/*.scss
---

- Use utility-first classes for rapid UI development
- Create reusable patterns with `@apply` in component styles
- Ensure responsive design using Tailwind responsive modifiers
- Configure theming (colors, spacing) in `tailwind.config.js`
- Purge unused styles in production builds

